  "goodToKnow": "Der Eigenbedarf is one's own needs or personal use. In German tenancy law, a landlord can end a rental contract wegen Eigenbedarfs if they or close family need the flat, one of the few valid reasons for terminating an unlimited lease; tenants often contest it in court. In drug law, small amounts für den Eigenbedarf (for personal use) are treated more leniently. It has no plural."
